   "date": "2013-06-20",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Military Justice (Interim Measures) Amendment Bill 2013 extends the tenure of the Chief Judge Advocate and other statutory office holders by two years, supported by the coalition to maintain the status quo while a permanent military court is developed. The speaker urged parliament not to delay, stressing the need for surety and clear processes for ADF personnel, especially those in combat zones."
  }
